== L01 Prop 3.5 identity: d/rho - d/(1-phi(1-rho)) == d(1-rho)(1-phi)/(rho(1-phi(1-rho)))
   identity and sign on grid: True
   at d=0: d/rho - limit = 0 (equality holds at d=0 since limit is 0)
   at d=0, phi=0, rho=1/2: limit 0 vs d/rho 0 -> equality with phi != 1 and rho != 1 (so the iff needs d>0)
